1px\">\n                            </i>\n                            SFX\n                        </span>\n                        to use\n                        <span class=\"word teal selection-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-3-4\" data-name=\"overlay word chip\">\n                            overlay\n                        </span>\n                        text.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"sentence secondary\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"transcript sentence secondary\">\n                        Text over here will help add,\n                        <span class=\"inline-chip tomato\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"quote style chip\">\n                            <i data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-4-1-1\" data-lucide=\"quote\" data-name=\"quote icon\" style=\"width:11px;height:11px\">\n                            </i>\n                            quote\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"word hot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"impact word chip\">\n                            impact\n                        </span>\n                        your\n                        <span class=\"word hot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"videos word chip\">\n                            videos\n                        </span>\n                        and make things\n                        <span class=\"inline-chip tomato\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-4-4\" data-name=\"pop style chip\">\n                            <i data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-4-4-1\" data-lucide=\"quote\" data-name=\"quote icon\" style=\"width:11px;height:11px\">\n                            </i>\n                            pop\n                        </span>\n                        .\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"sentence\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"transcript sentence\">\n                        <span class=\"inline-chip tomato\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"list style chip\">\n                            <i data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-5-1-1\" data-lucide=\"list-ordered\" data-name=\"list ordered icon\" style=\"width:11px;height:11px\">\n                            </i>\n                            list\n                        </span>\n                        Tip number two is\n                        <span class=\"inline-chip teal\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"sfx style chip\">\n                            <i data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-5-2-1\" data-lucide=\"volume-2\" data-name=\"volume icon\" style=\"width:11px;height:11px\">\n                            </i>\n                            SFX\n                        </span>\n                        to use\n                        <span class=\"word hot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-5-3\" data-name=\"zooms word chip\">\n                            zooms\n                        </span>\n                        .\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"sentence secondary\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-6\" data-name=\"transcript sentence secondary\">\n                        For specific words that you want to\n                        <span class=\"inline-chip tomato\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-6-1\" data-name=\"emphasize style chip\">\n                            <i data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-6-1-1\" data-lucide=\"quote\" data-name=\"quote icon\" style=\"width:11px;height:11px\">\n                            </i>\n                            emphasize\n                        </span>\n                        , try to\n                        <span class=\"inline-chip blue\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-6-2\" data-name=\"zoom style chip\">\n                            <i data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-6-2-1\" data-lucide=\"zoom-in\" data-name=\"zoom icon\" style=\"width:11px;height:11px\">\n                            </i>\n                            zoom\n                        </span>\n                        in to those words.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"sentence\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2